---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteBanner from '../components/QuoteBanner.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/home.css';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <main id="main-content" class="home-page page-shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-image"></div>
      <div class="mountain-overlay"></div>
      <div class="hero-content wide-container">
        <p class="hero-title">Remember Who You Are</p>
        <h1 class="subtitle">Reveal &amp; Remember: Guided Healing for Women</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-base prose-lg">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section">You've done the work.<br />Now you're ready to live it.</h2>
        <p class="about-intro">This is a space to remember what's already inside of you... and let it bloom.</p>
        <p>
          Reveal &amp; Remember is a place to rest. A place to feel held and heard. A place to feel safe
          enough to finally remember who you've always been beneath the layers of conditioning,
          expectation, and survival strategies. Take my hand, and let's unwind.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-alt prose-lg">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section">Is This You?</h2>
        <ul class="home-list">
          <li>You're intuitive, empathetic, and wise, but somehow you've ended up in a life that doesn't feel like yours.</li>
          <li>You're burned out, and you can't tell if it's you or the situation.</li>
          <li>Your life is good... but you know it can be better.</li>
          <li>You've tried it all (therapy, self-help, you name it), and you're ready for something deeper.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-base prose-lg">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section">How I Found My Way Home</h2>
        <p>
          As a doctor of clinical psychology trained at UC Berkeley and the PGSP-Stanford PsyD Consortium,
          I spent five years as a therapist, only to realize... <strong>I had no idea how to heal myself.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          That began my path into somatics, subconscious healing, and spiritual embodiment. Today, my work
          joins the foundations of psychology with the embodied wisdom I found when I learned to heal myself.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/about-me" class="text-link">Read my story &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-dark prose-lg work-section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section">Guided Healing</h2>
        <div class="work-options">
          <div class="work-option">
            <h3 class="heading-card heading-card--sm text-accent">What It Is</h3>
            <p>Experiential, meditative sessions bridging psychology with somatic, subconscious, and spiritual practice.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="work-option">
            <h3 class="heading-card heading-card--sm text-accent">Main Methods</h3>
            <p>IFS-based parts work, subconscious healing, somatics, and guided meditation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="work-option">
            <h3 class="heading-card heading-card--sm text-accent">Format</h3>
            <p>60&ndash;90 minutes, online via Zoom, for women anywhere.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="work-tagline">"Guided by me, but determined by you."</p>
        <p class="work-note"><em>Group offerings coming soon.</em></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-alt prose-lg text-center">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section">In Their Words</h2>
        <figure class="home-testimonial">
          <blockquote class="text-quote">"I feel as if I can finally connect with my body and appreciate everything about who I am. I'm extraordinary!"</blockquote>
          <figcaption>&mdash;Client Reflection</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p><a href="/testimonials" class="text-link">Read more reflections &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact-mobile surface-base prose-lg">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2 class="heading-section text-center">Begin the Conversation</h2>
        <p class="text-center">Curious if we're a fit? It starts with a free 20-minute consult.</p>
        <ol class="begin-steps">
          <li><strong>Book your free consult.</strong> We'll talk about what's happening for you and what you're longing for.</li>
          <li><strong>Feel into the fit.</strong> Together we'll sense whether guided healing is right for you, with no pressure either way.</li>
          <li><strong>Begin.</strong> If it feels aligned, we'll schedule your first session: 60&ndash;90 minutes on Zoom, wherever you are.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="text-center">
          <a href={site.calendlyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="cta-button">SCHEDULE A CONSULT</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <QuoteBanner quote=`"You are a masterpiece — a piece of the master."` author="— Rabbi David Aaron" />
</BaseLayout>
